   "description": "The Vostra Vesta Ring Watches have arrived! Command the Astral Forces by collecting all five variants of the Vostra Vesta ring watch. The Triple Blind includes THREE 'blind boxes' so you can triple the thrill of discovering your Astral Forces , increase your odds at unveiling the Legendary Chase , or just have two more for your friends! In each 'blind box', y ou'll receive ONE OF FIVE ring watches: COMMON (1:2.08) Starforge Silver Void Signet UNCOMMON (1:5.67) Nebula Splash RARE (1:10) Stellar Fusion Radiant Pulse Featuring a Legendary Chase , 1:499 odds of revealing 1 of 2 diamond bezel Astral Nexus variants. Cosmic Eclipse (blackout variant) is UNAVAILABLE in the blind box and can only be acquired in the Formation Pack. NOTES: Please note that in the Triple Blind , you will receive THREE blind-boxed ring watches - there is NO GUARANTEE that you will not get duplicates . Each Vostra Vesta purchased in the 'blind box' format has been blind packaged in a foil bag, individually factory shrink wrapped and master mixed to maintain rarity ratio. These units are an INDEPENDENT batch, separately packaged from the Formation Pack units.",
